=== text ===
|■ Help                                                                  |
|  /resume      Resume a session from history                            |
|  /new         Clear the chat and start over                            |
|  /model       Switch the model and effort                              |
|  /status      Show the version and session info                        |
|  /usage       Show context, tokens and cost                            |
|  /undo        Move the workspace back one turn                         |
|  /redo        Move the workspace forward one turn                      |
|  /continue    Continue from where the chat ends                        |
|  /checkout    Check out a point in the session tree                    |
|  /copy        Copy the last reply                                      |
|  /export      Save the chat as Markdown                                |
|  /config      Change the settings                                      |
|  /login       Authenticate with a provider account                     |
|  /help        List commands and keys                                   |
|  /quit        Exit                                                     |
|                                                                        |
|  enter        Send the prompt, or queue it during a run                |
|  shift+enter  Start a new line                                         |
|  alt+enter    Send now, stopping the run                               |
|  esc          Stop the run                                             |
|  ctrl+c       Clear the input, or quit when pressed twice              |
|  ctrl+o       Expand or collapse the tool calls                        |
|  ctrl+u       Pin or unpin the usage box                               |
|  shift+tab    Cycle the reasoning effort                               |
|  pgup/pgdn    Scroll the transcript                                    |
|                                                                        |
|                                                                        |
